Input: {"question": "What position does Vickie Sawyer currently or formerly hold?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 77, "text": "**Breaking News: Vickie Sawyer Confirmed as Member of North Carolina Senate**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 79, "end": 268, "text": "Raleigh, NC - In a move that solidifies her position as a prominent figure in North Carolina politics, Vickie Sawyer has been officially recognized as a Member of the North Carolina Senate."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 269, "end": 419, "text": "According to official records and sources within the North Carolina General Assembly, Sawyer has been serving as a senator since her election in 2019."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 420, "end": 558, "text": "Her tenure has been marked by a strong commitment to her constituents and a dedication to addressing the pressing issues facing the state."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 559, "end": 671, "text": "\"I am honored to serve the people of North Carolina and to be a part of the Senate,\" Sawyer said in a statement."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 672, "end": 806, "text": "\"As a senator, I am committed to working tirelessly to ensure that our state remains a great place to live, work, and raise a family.\""}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 807, "end": 1013, "text": "Sawyer's position as a Member of the North Carolina Senate is substantiated by her official biography on the North Carolina General Assembly's website, which lists her as a senator representing District 34."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1014, "end": 1139, "text": "Additionally, her voting record and committee assignments are publicly available, further solidifying her role in the Senate."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1140, "end": 1277, "text": "\"Vickie Sawyer has been a valuable addition to the Senate,\" said Senator Phil Berger, President Pro Tempore of the North Carolina Senate."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1278, "end": 1428, "text": "\"Her dedication to her constituents and her commitment to finding solutions to the state's challenges have made her a respected voice in the chamber.\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1429, "end": 1589, "text": "Data from the North Carolina State Board of Elections confirms Sawyer's election to the Senate in 2019, with her receiving over 60% of the vote in her district."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1590, "end": 1739, "text": "As a Member of the North Carolina Senate, Sawyer has been instrumental in shaping policy and legislation that affects the lives of North Carolinians."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1740, "end": 1883, "text": "Her work on committees such as Education, Health Care, and Transportation has helped to drive progress and improvement in these critical areas."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1884, "end": 2042, "text": "\"Vickie Sawyer's experience and expertise have been invaluable to our committee work,\" said Senator Ralph Hise, Chairman of the Senate Committee on Education."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2043, "end": 2191, "text": "\"Her commitment to education and her passion for improving outcomes for our students have made a real difference in the lives of North Carolinians.\""}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2192, "end": 2355, "text": "With her position as a Member of the North Carolina Senate firmly established, Sawyer is poised to continue making a positive impact on the state and its citizens."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2356, "end": 2368, "text": "**Sources:**"}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2370, "end": 2404, "text": "* North Carolina General Assembly."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2405, "end": 2412, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2413, "end": 2435, "text": "Senator Vickie Sawyer."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2436, "end": 2504, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.ncleg.gov\\/Members\\/Biography\\/S\\/234>"}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2505, "end": 2547, "text": "* North Carolina State Board of Elections."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2548, "end": 2555, "text": "(2019)."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 127, "text": "**HEADLINE:** American Politician Vickie Sawyer Makes History as First Foreign-Born Municipal Councilor in Saint-Yvoine, France"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 129, "end": 354, "text": "**SAINT-YVOINE, FRANCE** - In a groundbreaking move, the small town of Saint-Yvoine in the Puy-de-Dôme region of France has elected American politician Vickie Sawyer as its newest conseiller municipal, or municipal councilor."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 355, "end": 477, "text": "This unprecedented appointment marks the first time a foreign-born individual has held the position in the town's history."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 478, "end": 632, "text": "Sawyer, a seasoned politician from the United States, brings a wealth of experience to the role, having served in various capacities in American politics."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 633, "end": 805, "text": "Her unique perspective and skillset are expected to bring a fresh dynamic to the council, which is responsible for making key decisions on local governance and development."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 806, "end": 925, "text": "\"I am thrilled and honored to be a part of this community,\" Sawyer said in an exclusive interview with our publication."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 926, "end": 1026, "text": "\"As an American, I never thought I'd have the opportunity to serve in a French municipal government."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1027, "end": 1158, "text": "But the people of Saint-Yvoine have welcomed me with open arms, and I'm excited to contribute to the town's growth and prosperity.\""}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1159, "end": 1286, "text": "Sawyer's appointment was met with enthusiasm from local residents, who see her as a breath of fresh air in the town's politics."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1287, "end": 1369, "text": "\"We're delighted to have Vickie on board,\" said Saint-Yvoine Mayor, Pierre Dupont."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1370, "end": 1487, "text": "\"Her international experience and perspective will undoubtedly enrich our discussions and decision-making processes.\""}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1488, "end": 1648, "text": "According to data from the French Ministry of the Interior, Sawyer's election marks a significant shift in the demographics of municipal councils across France."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1649, "end": 1779, "text": "While foreigners have long been eligible to vote in local elections, Sawyer's appointment is the first of its kind in the country."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1780, "end": 1856, "text": "\"This is a historic moment for our town and for France as a whole,\" said Dr."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1857, "end": 1933, "text": "Sophie Laurent, a political scientist at the University of Clermont-Ferrand."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1934, "end": 2131, "text": "\"Vickie Sawyer's election demonstrates the growing trend of internationalization in local politics, and we can expect to see more foreign-born individuals taking on leadership roles in the future.\""}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2132, "end": 2328, "text": "Sawyer's first council meeting is scheduled for next week, where she will join her fellow councilors to discuss pressing issues such as infrastructure development and environmental sustainability."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2329, "end": 2481, "text": "As she takes on this new role, Sawyer is committed to listening to the concerns of Saint-Yvoine's residents and working collaboratively to address them."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2482, "end": 2572, "text": "\"I'm eager to get started and make a positive impact on this beautiful town,\" Sawyer said."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Vickie Sawyer", "scope": "Saint-Yvoine, France", "claim": "Vickie Sawyer was elected as the newest conseiller municipal, or municipal councilor, in the small town of Saint-Yvoine in the Puy-de-Dôme region of France.", "answer": "conseiller municipal, or municipal councilor", "quote": "**SAINT-YVOINE, FRANCE** - In a groundbreaking move, the small town of Saint-Yvoine in the Puy-de-Dôme region of France has elected American politician Vickie Sawyer as its newest conseiller municipal, or municipal councilor.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Member of the North Carolina Senate", "Municipal Councilor", "Conseiller municipal"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Member of the North Carolina Senate", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Municipal Councilor", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "Conseiller municipal", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}

